@startuml seq-stellar-gas
actor Person
participant App
participant "Wallet Core" as WC
participant "StellarRelayer\n(sponsor account G…)" as Rel
participant "Stellar" as XLM
participant "Person's smart\naccount (C…)" as SA

Person -> App : send USDC or XLM, move to EVM
App -> App : the Ed25519 key signs only the authorization\nof that call (expires in 5 min)
App -> WC : call + signed authorization
WC -> WC : is the call allowed?\ndoes it avoid the sponsor's authority?\nis it within the daily budget?
WC -> Rel : send
Rel -> XLM : transaction with the sponsor account as source:\nit signs and pays the fee (max 0.5 XLM)
XLM -> SA : __check_auth: verifies the Ed25519 signature
SA -> SA : executes the call
WC --> App : transaction hash
@enduml
